    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST NOW</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.poster.avif?t=1739809642\" width=620 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.webm?t=1739809642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.mp4?t=1739809642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agora Project is a psychological horror game where you unveil a short story inspired by a Real Killer.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Agora Project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mary Williams, an 18-year-old girl, is going to a  party with her friends. When she ordered the Taxi, she couldn't shake the feeling that something was off, little did she know who was driving her to the party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/extras/d2cbd81ab1aa8e240c58c97180acf9f4.poster.avif?t=1739809642\" width=554 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/extras/d2cbd81ab1aa8e240c58c97180acf9f4.webm?t=1739809642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2988440/extras/d2cbd81ab1aa8e240c58c97180acf9f4.mp4?t=1739809642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration and conversation mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo-realistic graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to NPCs</p></li></ul>",
